SSSTRAVELTIME
+++++++++++++

SUMMARY
-------
Computes traveltime of selected phases for pre-defined velocity models
Description and examples assume the calls are made from within SSS.
The source file is the same as the non-SSS version, and this file has
only an example that uses SSS plotting.  For the full description, see
TRAVELTIME_.

EXAMPLE
-------
::

     SAC> datagen sub deep  kev.r kip.r pas.r bla.r
     SAC> rtr
     SAC> traveltime quiet picks 0 phase sPP
     SAC> traveltime  quiet picks 1 phase P pP sP S sS
     SAC> SSS
     SAC> dw units degrees fixed 50 90
     SAC> tw 400 1500
     SAC> prs orient port ttime on
     SAC> save sakhalin-picks-prs.pdf

Note that *PRS* does not work for distance in kilometers.

